 5. 🚨 Trump&#x27;s midair spy warning 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang — pictured with U.S. Trade Representative Jamieson Greer, Defense Secretary Pete Hegseth, Secretary of State Marco Rubio and Elon Musk — steps off Air Force One during President Trump's trip to China in May. Photo: Brendan Smialowski/AFP via Getty Images Secretary of State Marco Rubio personally warned President Trump about Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang's relationship with a suspected Chinese spy during a flight to China in May, The New York Times reports . 

 The warning came before Huang boarded Air Force One at a refueling stop in Anchorage. 📝 Behind the scenes: Rubio oversaw the preparation of a highly classified memo detailing Huang's relationship with Alice Huang, whom U.S. intelligence officials believe is a Chinese intelligence agent.

 The memo drew on surveillance of Alice Huang and a chip-smuggling investigation into her company, Megaspeed. 👉 Axios scoop: Commerce Secretary Howard Lutnick — who oversees efforts to keep sensitive U.S. technology out of the hands of American adversaries — also received the classified memo, Axios' Maria Curi and Marc Caputo report . 

